---
description: Design handoff rules for the Projects mobile screens (KIS Creativity Space Flutter app + mobile web)
alwaysApply: false
---

When implementing the Projects mobile screens:

- The spec is handoff_cursor_projects_mobile/README.md — source of truth for layout, tokens, copy, and behavior. Values are exact, not suggestions.
- designs/KIS Mobile Designs.dc.html is a static mockup for reference only (section 13). Never copy its markup or support.js.
- Kanban is NEVER a horizontal three-column scroll on mobile: use the status-tab pattern from 13d/13f.
- Share links go through the bottom sheet (13e) → native share sheet; the two link types must be visually distinct (VIEW ONLY amber vs CAN EDIT blue) before sharing.
- Access matrix, editKey validation, and server-side enforcement are defined in handoff_cursor_projects_auth_sharing — reuse, don't redefine.
- Status change = immediate persist + snackbar with sprint number and new status; card animates to its new tab. Overdue (past due, not done) = red date + red card edge.
- Tap targets ≥ 44px; pills radius 999px; cards 12–14px radius; black app bar with 3px red rule.
